-> steps to run project

	goto following locations:
		1:  d:/projects/portfolio king/portfolio-king
			Type cmd in address bar
			A command prompt will open. Type following command in it.
			if new code is pushed then type following commands
			git stash
			git pull origin master
			then run following command
			npm run start
		2:  d:/projects/portfolio king/portfolio-king-server
			Type cmd in address bar
			A command prompt will open. Type following command in it.
			if new code is pushed then type following commands
			git stash
			git pull origin master
			then run following command
			nodemon
	open localhost:4200/
	
-> steps to change server
	
	open notepad++
	change endpoint in 4 opened files